<title>MALAYSIA: SOCCER-DUNHILL CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DUNHILL CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the finals of</p>
<p>the eight-nation Dunhill Cup soccer tournament on Sunday:</p>
<p>    China   3    Bosnia (halftime 0-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Li Jinyu 56, Zhang Xiqorui 59, Hao Haidong 81</p>
